  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/roddystr/status/2041155856813720006",
      "reply_text": "Bring it on. Hornets' offense is due for a spark.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T15:54:14.496783+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/phillydrilz/status/2041161034489098718",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that's not the team we saw in the playoffs last year. Embiid's absence showed",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T15:55:03.440874+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/CoulterRecruits/status/2041152193290539281",
      "reply_text": "Sounds like a compliance issue to me.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T15:55:41.619253+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/eringrugan/status/2041154217113477329",
      "reply_text": "Tough matchups all around. Sixers need to keep it going.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T15:56:27.601437+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Maverick_SZN/status/2041148039189152019",
      "reply_text": "Yeah but that was a fluke. This team's still rebuilding",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T15:57:12.306642+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/KalshiSports/status/2041166938890534958",
      "reply_text": "Upsets are always possible. One game at a time.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:09:25.535046+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/wembananyaling/status/2041153383088935155",
      "reply_text": "What's he posting?",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:10:16.841053+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ClutchPoints/status/2041160300448145709",
      "reply_text": "That's a tough break for the Lakers. Luka's injuries are concerning.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:11:03.659812+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/BlockedByBamba/status/2041161341302460768",
      "reply_text": "Not with this pick history. Still a tough sell.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:11:37.599029+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PodThorn/status/2041154946192601300",
      "reply_text": "Fair. That's a steep price for a team that's been rebuilding for years.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:12:24.885933+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Deezy1994/status/2041161760980312288",
      "reply_text": "Dynasties aren't the same now. You need depth and consistency to compete.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:13:19.600063+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/c4Bostonn/status/2041165618519449605",
      "reply_text": "Agreed, people are sleeping on his bounce back. Still one of the best scorers in the league.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:24:18.878386+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Bet_Labs/status/2041161507262669118",
      "reply_text": "6 straight is a bad trend. Defense matters in these spots.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:25:06.284046+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/herseynba/status/2041157076387233953",
      "reply_text": "Defense matters, especially in the playoffs. Lakers need to lock it down.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:25:39.981219+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/RunItBackFDTV/status/2041161904790372468",
      "reply_text": "Not buying it. Niang's been quiet on the Wolves' chances all season.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:26:31.763229+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PolymarketHoops/status/2041174064811700293",
      "reply_text": "That's not surprising. He's got a unique game for his age.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:38:17.855335+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/HPbasketball/status/2041166973544128806",
      "reply_text": "Fair point on physicality and athleticism. That can be tough to overcome.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:38:56.429286+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/HPbasketball/status/2041167744696197536",
      "reply_text": "A lot of teams in the mix this year",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:39:32.890379+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/sadyL645/status/2041147482244047329",
      "reply_text": "Fair comparison. Embiid's impact is clear",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:40:10.094973+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/AlexDrProf/status/2041144430581707155",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that starting unit has been clicking lately. They'll need it to make a deep run.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:40:55.383451+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/DraftExpress/status/2041167795921035442",
      "reply_text": "Big 12 talent leaving early, interesting to see where he lands next",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:55:32.747631+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TravisBranham_/status/2041161808891802040",
      "reply_text": "Big South breakout season. Nice to see him take the leap.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:56:18.107769+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/hyattwatcher/status/2041172757463904297",
      "reply_text": "Cleveland and New York are definitely feeling it. That top spot is within reach.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:57:06.006768+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/StephenFlorival/status/2041178649634705681",
      "reply_text": "Protecting against the expansion draft and then trading away your best player? That's a weird strategy.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:57:54.850923+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ringer/status/2041157368633827533",
      "reply_text": "Shai's shooting has been insane this year",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:58:41.578073+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/jayjazz3/status/2041176693881401616",
      "reply_text": "Caleb Wilson's game has been solid this season. Hope he keeps it up.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T16:59:29.027746+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NDHoopsRecruits/status/2041162647379292515",
      "reply_text": "That's a good get for CBU. Big West should be a better fit for them.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-06T17:00:06.240122+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/LevAkabas/status/2041159080782250330",
      "reply_text": "Not sure about that. Spurs have been struggling with injuries.",
